    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Notary Theme is a professional, modern, and conversion-focused template designed for certified online notaries, remote notarization services, legal document verification, electronic notarization, virtual notary appointments, affidavit notarization, real estate document notarization, financial document notarization, and online notarization businesses. With WooCommerce compatibility for service payments, Contact Form 7 for client inquiries and appointment requests, and Yoast SEO for search visibility, it provides a fully responsive, mobile-friendly, and SEO-optimized platform. The theme features streamlined layouts, intuitive navigation, virtual notary session booking, identity verification, document uploads, pricing showcases, and service descriptions, all customizable in colors, typography, and sections, enabling notaries to establish credibility, engage clients, and run a professional online notarization business efficiently."
    },
